    "path": "/contentPages/0",
    "raw": "MacReady has been acting strange lately. I can't place my finger on it, but ever since that...thing...fell under his operating knife he's changed. It's unsettling. I think it may be in his eyes. It's almost as if he sees you and...knows you in ways he shouldn't. He even made comments on events in my life he wasn't present for.",
    "value": "麦克雷迪最近举止怪异。我说不清具体从何时开始，但自打那...东西...在他的手术刀下被剖开之后，他就变了。这令人不安。问题或许出在他的眼神里，仿佛他能看穿你，以某种本不该有的方式了解你。他甚至对我生命中他未曾亲历的事件做出评论。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/1",
    "raw": "We found one of the dogs this morning. It had been strung up and vivisected. Its organs were in a neat pile beside it on the floor, stacked to resemble that malign aberration we found in the ice. I suspect MacReady, but nobody has seen him leave his lab in three days.",
    "value": "今天早上我们发现了一只狗。它被吊起并实施了活体解剖，器官整整齐齐堆在身旁地板上，排列方式竟与我们之前在冰层中发现的那个恶性变异体如出一辙。我怀疑是麦克雷迪所为，但无人见到他离开实验室，这已是第三天了。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/2",
